+ Play games with your friends.
You can now play online games with your friends using the "online fix" method.
Go to your game library in the Steam app, select the game you want, right-click it and select Properties; then, under the General tab, enter "--onlinefix" in the Launch Options field.

Note: Your friends must use the same method.

+ The game is not running or is encountering an error.
The game isn't working or throws an error upon startup (e.g., error 3:00000123)... try using the "Game Fix" option in the Library tab... you can use Goldberg or Steamless...

+ How to fix "Purchases"
You can go to settings, and update Gemesak Core.
